findings.message:
buildTemplateReviewPrompt orders the reviewer prompt as instructions (system) -> checklist/template -> design. The approved order is template first, then the instructions, then the design last. The design is still last, but the template and the instructions are swapped (the function's own doc comment states 'the instructions come first, then the template'). The validation-repeat prompt in template-review.ts inherits the same order (`${system}

${correction}

${user}`).
